---
import TerminalSimulator from '../react/TerminalSimulator';
---

<section id="demo" class="py-20 border-t border-brand-hairline dark:border-brand-border/80 transition-colors">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink dark:text-ivory" data-i18n="demo_title">实况演示</h2>
      <p class="text-brand-muted mt-3" data-i18n="demo_subtitle">从用户输入到 &lt;FINAL_ANSWER&gt; 的完整 ReAct 循环：统一引擎驱动，权限看门狗把关。点击播放，遇到权限请求时会暂停等你批准。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <TerminalSimulator client:visible />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
